#. :src: bpy.types.LineStyleColorModifier_Curvature_3D
msgid "Change line color based on the radial curvature of 3D mesh surfaces"
msgstr "Ändra linjefärg baserat på den radiella krökningen hos 3D-meshytor"

#. :src: bpy.types.GreasePencilLineartModifier.crease_threshold
msgid ""
"Angles smaller than this will be treated as creases. Crease angle priority: "
"object Line Art crease override > mesh auto smooth angle > Line Art default "
"crease."
msgstr ""
"Vinklar som är mindre än detta behandlas som veck. Prioritet för veckvinkel: "
"objektets Linjekonst-veckåsidosättning > meshens automatiska "
"utjämningsvinkel > Linjekonstens standardveck."

#. :src: bpy.types.MeshCacheModifier.deform_mode:'INTEGRATE'
msgid ""
"Integrate deformation from this modifier's input with the mesh-cache "
"coordinates (useful for shape keys)"
msgstr ""
"Integrera deformation från denna modifierares indata med "
"meshcachekoordinaterna (användbart för formnycklar)"

#. :src: bpy.types.WM_OT_usd_export.export_subdivision:'BEST_MATCH'
msgid ""
"Scheme = Catmull-Clark, when possible. Reverts to exporting the subdivided "
"mesh for the Simple subdivision type"
msgstr ""
"Schema = Catmull-Clark när det är möjligt. Återgår till att exportera den "
"underindelade meshen för underindelningstypen Simple"

#: source/blender/editors/object/object_shapekey.cc:693
msgid ""
"Mirror the active shape key along the local X axis using topology based "
"mirroring\n"
"(for when both sides of mesh have matching, unique topology)"
msgstr ""
"Spegla den aktiva formnyckeln längs den lokala X-axeln med topologibaserad "
"spegling\n"
"(när båda sidor av meshen har matchande, unik topologi)"

#: source/blender/io/usd/intern/usd_skel_convert.cc:512
#: source/blender/io/usd/intern/usd_skel_convert.cc:537
msgid ""
"%s: Number of offsets greater than number of mesh vertices for blend shape %s"
msgstr ""
"%s: Antalet förskjutningar är större än antalet hörnpunkter i meshen för "
"blandningsformen %s"

#: source/blender/nodes/geometry/nodes/node_geo_dual_mesh.cc:28
msgid ""
"Keep non-manifold boundaries of the input mesh in place by avoiding the dual "
"transformation there"
msgstr ""
"Behåll icke-manifoldgränser i indatameshen på plats genom att undvika den "
"dubbla transformeringen där"

#: source/blender/nodes/geometry/nodes/node_geo_subdivision_surface.cc:240
msgid "Subdivision failed for some geometry. Original mesh returned."
msgstr "Underindelning misslyckades för viss geometri. Ursprungsmeshen returneras."

#: source/blender/nodes/geometry/nodes/node_geo_tool_active_element.cc:22
msgid "True if an active element exists in the mesh, false otherwise"
msgstr "Sant om ett aktivt element finns i meshen, annars falskt"

#: source/blender/nodes/geometry/nodes/node_geo_uv_unwrap.cc:46
msgid "Edges to mark where the mesh is \"cut\" for the purposes of unwrapping"
msgstr "Kanter att markera där meshen ”klipps” vid uppackning"

#. :src: Socket description from node group Cloth Dynamics (Experimental), file geometry_nodes_dynamics_assets.blend
msgid "Enable dynamic tearing of the mesh."
msgstr "Aktivera dynamisk sönderrivning av meshen."

#. :src: Socket description from node group Collider, file geometry_nodes_dynamics_assets.blend
msgid ""
"If true, the simulated geometry should stay within the mesh instead of it "
"being pushed out of it."
msgstr ""
"Om sant ska den simulerade geometrin stanna inom meshen i stället för att "
"pressas ut ur den."

#. :src: Socket description from node group Hair Dynamics, file geometry_nodes_dynamics_assets.blend
msgid "The surface mesh is deforming."
msgstr "Ytmeshen deformeras."

#. :src: Socket description from node group Hair Dynamics, file geometry_nodes_dynamics_assets.blend
msgid "Collide with the surface mesh the hair is attached to."
msgstr "Kolliderar med ytmeshen som håret är fäst vid."

#. :src: Socket description from node group Hair Dynamics, file geometry_nodes_dynamics_assets.blend
msgid "Settings for collisions with the surface mesh."
msgstr "Inställningar för kollisioner med ytmeshen."

#. :src: Socket description from node group Curve to Tube, file geometry_nodes_essentials.blend
msgid ""
"Combine the cap geometry with the base mesh (realizing instances and merging "
"vertices)"
msgstr ""
"Kombinera lockets geometri med basmeshen (genom att realisera instanser och "
"slå samman hörnpunkter)"

#. :src: Socket description from node group Curve to Tube, file geometry_nodes_essentials.blend
msgid "Use smooth vertex normals instead of face normals for the result mesh"
msgstr ""
"Använder jämna hörnpunktsnormaler i stället för ytnormaler för "
"resultatmeshen"

#. :src: Socket description from node group Is Edge Boundary, file geometry_nodes_essentials.blend
msgid "Selection of edges that are part of the boundary of a mesh surface"
msgstr "Urval av kanter som ingår i gränsen för en meshyta"

#. :src: Menu item description from node group Attach Hair Curves to Surface, file procedural_hair_node_assets.blend
#. :src: Menu item description from node group Generate Hair Curves, file procedural_hair_node_assets.blend
msgid "Use the incoming surface input mesh"
msgstr "Använder den inkommande ytmeshen"
